menu "Task heartbeats (application supervision)"

    config TASK_HB_FROZEN_MS
        int "Heartbeat frozen threshold (ms)"
        default 10000
        range 2000 60000
        help
            A task heartbeat counter that does not change for this long is
            logged as a fault with reason code HB_FROZEN_<task>.

    config TASK_HB_LINK_RESTART_MS
        int "mqtt_pub frozen threshold for a link restart (ms)"
        default 30000
        range 10000 300000
        help
            A frozen mqtt_pub heartbeat for this long triggers
            mqtt_link_stop/start (reason HB_LINK_RESTART_MQTT_PUB).

    config TASK_HB_RESTART_WINDOW_MS
        int "Window for escalating to esp_restart (ms)"
        default 600000
        range 60000 3600000
        help
            A second frozen mqtt_pub heartbeat within this window after a
            link restart triggers a logged esp_restart (reason
            HB_RESTART_MQTT_PUB). Non-safety auto-recovery with a cap.

    config TASK_HB_REBOOT_CAP
        int "Heartbeat reboots allowed before degraded mode"
        default 3
        range 0 10
        help
            Number of HB_RESTART_MQTT_PUB reboots tolerated within one
            stable-uptime period. The count lives in RTC_NOINIT memory so it
            survives esp_restart without NVS wear and is cleared by a power
            cycle or an invalid record. Once reached the device stays up in
            degraded mode (link restarts only, status hb_degraded=1).

    config TASK_HB_REBOOT_STABLE_MS
        int "Uptime after which the reboot counter is cleared (ms)"
        default 3600000
        range 60000 86400000
        help
            Running this long without a heartbeat reboot clears the reboot
            counter and the degraded flag.

endmenu
